00:14:52.330 --> 00:14:54.190
That is the Kaleido Stage.

00:14:58.930 --> 00:14:59.630
Hurry!

00:14:59.630 --> 00:14:59.770
Okay!

00:14:59.630 --> 00:14:59.770
