00:15:07.540 --> 00:15:08.580
Good luck.

00:15:08.580 --> 00:15:09.410
Thanks.

00:15:12.510 --> 00:15:14.410
That was a quick change...

00:15:23.090 --> 00:15:25.680
I'm not allowed to show a tired look.

00:15:35.970 --> 00:15:36.960
Here!

00:15:37.510 --> 00:15:40.960
Even Sora must have reached her limits
since she has been going nonstop.

00:15:44.180 --> 00:15:47.210
I've never seen a person as reckless as her.

00:15:47.210 --> 00:15:50.580
I've never seen anyone who goes
as far as she does, either.

00:15:52.290 --> 00:15:56.920
But the one who becomes a real shining star
could be someone like her.

00:15:58.960 --> 00:16:01.030
Destroying monsters while spinning...

00:16:01.030 --> 00:16:02.150
Can she do it?

00:16:10.140 --> 00:16:15.400
Landing on top of that mountain while
spinning is difficult in and of itself...

00:16:15.580 --> 00:16:17.680
Since she is staggering that much,

00:16:17.680 --> 00:16:19.350
she has no choice but to slow down the spin.

00:16:19.350 --> 00:16:20.410
But...

00:16:20.410 --> 00:16:22.680
if she does that,
the maneuver will be incomplete.

00:16:28.390 --> 00:16:29.880
She's speeding up?

00:16:33.260 --> 00:16:34.350
What?!

00:16:56.620 --> 00:16:58.090
She's so awkward.

00:16:58.090 --> 00:17:00.140
I can't keep watching her.

00:17:00.550 --> 00:17:01.350
But...

00:17:02.220 --> 00:17:06.860
Without a doubt, I've never
seen her type before.

00:17:06.860 --> 00:17:09.850
Sora Naegino...

00:17:10.200 --> 00:17:13.000
The last scene is the reunion with the princess.

00:17:13.000 --> 00:17:14.230
Go!

00:17:15.100 --> 00:17:16.900
Go for it!

00:17:21.640 --> 00:17:26.050
From this point, the directing will
change depending on Sora's ideas.

00:17:26.050 --> 00:17:27.340
So, I will give you instructions.

00:17:27.550 --> 00:17:28.850
Roger that.

00:17:29.220 --> 00:17:31.050
Ken, are you ready?

00:17:31.050 --> 00:17:31.850
I'm ready.

00:17:50.370 --> 00:17:52.000
Okay, turn off the light.

00:17:54.540 --> 00:17:56.270
A-5, turn the spot light on.

00:18:00.180 --> 00:18:01.850
Wow! It's the princess!

00:18:01.850 --> 00:18:02.850
You're right!

00:18:02.850 --> 00:18:04.370
There's the princess!

00:18:05.550 --> 00:18:06.950
All right, she is doing well.

00:18:06.950 --> 00:18:08.080
It's so pretty.

00:18:09.360 --> 00:18:10.380
Turn the light off.

00:18:11.630 --> 00:18:12.850
Turn the B light on.

00:18:15.430 --> 00:18:16.230
Okay.

00:18:16.600 --> 00:18:18.000
I pulled it off!

00:18:18.000 --> 00:18:20.470
In the last scenes, I should throw myself
into the protagonist's state of mind.

00:18:20.470 --> 00:18:23.370
And hold her gently with all my love.

00:18:24.970 --> 00:18:26.740
Leon!

00:18:27.710 --> 00:18:29.680
Bring out Mr. Leon!

00:18:29.680 --> 00:18:30.970
Take a hike!

00:18:32.210 --> 00:18:38.710
Leon! Leon! Leon! Leon!

00:18:39.120 --> 00:18:42.090
I'm scared.

00:18:42.090 --> 00:18:48.100
Leon! Leon! Leon! Leon!

00:18:48.100 --> 00:18:49.430
Leon! Leon! Leon! Leon! Leon! Leon!

00:18:49.430 --> 00:18:51.760
You should learn that the audience
is a performer's enemy.

00:18:52.170 --> 00:18:54.130
Her performance went well, but they...

00:18:54.470 --> 00:18:56.770
This isn't good.

00:19:17.390 --> 00:19:18.690
What?

00:19:19.590 --> 00:19:22.690
How pitiful, Sora Naegino.

00:19:23.500 --> 00:19:24.050
Excuse me?

00:19:24.800 --> 00:19:29.570
You were rejected as Leon Oswald's
partner, weren't you?

00:19:29.940 --> 00:19:31.910
Isn't that why you're performing for two?

00:19:33.610 --> 00:19:35.010
What shall we do?

00:19:35.010 --> 00:19:37.410
Uh... Well... Well...

00:19:37.410 --> 00:19:39.210
I don't care. Let them continue.

00:19:40.080 --> 00:19:41.050
Yes, sir.

00:19:49.160 --> 00:19:50.620
What?

00:19:50.620 --> 00:19:52.790
Is she a trapeze artist?

00:19:53.090 --> 00:19:57.330
Eternal Angel Turn!

00:19:59.770 --> 00:20:03.700
She uses the swing so easily and freely.

00:20:04.270 --> 00:20:06.240
Dream Spiral!

00:20:06.710 --> 00:20:08.040
Amazing...

00:20:08.040 --> 00:20:11.240
She's so bold, and her performance
is overflowing with confidence.

00:20:17.080 --> 00:20:18.220
Do you understand?

00:20:18.220 --> 00:20:21.090
I can be Leon's partner.

00:20:21.220 --> 00:20:24.450
But you cannot, Sora Naegino.

00:20:25.030 --> 00:20:25.990
Who is that?

00:20:25.990 --> 00:20:30.690
I believe she's the girl who passed with
the highest scores in this year's audition.

00:20:31.170 --> 00:20:32.230
What's going on?

00:20:32.230 --> 00:20:33.500
Is this part of the show?

00:20:33.500 --> 00:20:34.690
I wonder if it is.

00:20:34.970 --> 00:20:36.990
Mr. Leon!

00:20:37.810 --> 00:20:39.110
But she's pretty cute, isn't she?

00:20:39.110 --> 00:20:40.840
She is totally my kind of gal.

00:20:44.480 --> 00:20:46.340
Excuse me... Who are you?

00:20:46.850 --> 00:20:48.140
Me?

00:20:48.520 --> 00:20:51.010
I'm the next Layla Hamilton!

00:20:51.290 --> 00:20:52.380
What?

00:20:52.790 --> 00:20:54.760
I'm going to kick you out.

00:20:54.760 --> 00:20:57.320
And I will be the Kaleido Star.

00:20:57.760 --> 00:21:01.490
From now on, I won't let you call yourself
a Kaleido Star when you have no talent.

00:21:02.860 --> 00:21:04.990
Do you understand?

00:21:07.940 --> 00:21:09.630
Mr. Leon!

00:21:10.770 --> 00:21:14.170
If either of them could be my partner,

00:21:15.740 --> 00:21:18.040
it may be worth it to stay on a little longer.

00:21:20.850 --> 00:21:22.340
Mr. Leon...

00:21:22.820 --> 00:21:24.220
I changed my mind.

00:21:24.750 --> 00:21:26.950
I wouldn't mind staying here a little longer.

00:21:27.190 --> 00:21:28.390
Really?

00:21:28.390 --> 00:21:29.890
Then you'll appear on stage with me...

00:21:29.890 --> 00:21:30.060
Not with you. With me!

00:21:29.890 --> 00:21:30.060
Then you'll appear on stage with me...

00:21:30.060 --> 00:21:32.120
Not with you. With me!

00:21:32.360 --> 00:21:35.590
Mr. Leon certainly is great.
He can see how talented I am!

00:21:36.000 --> 00:21:38.500
Both of you. Ad-lib and follow me.

00:21:38.500 --> 00:21:39.860
Let's go!

00:21:40.300 --> 00:21:41.460
Yes!

00:21:42.940 --> 00:21:46.130
Wonder Hop!

00:21:47.780 --> 00:21:48.740
Arrow!

00:21:57.320 --> 00:21:58.650
What is this?

00:21:58.650 --> 00:21:59.620
They're fighting.

00:22:02.490 --> 00:22:03.890
If I remember right,

00:22:03.890 --> 00:22:05.530
that's the girl who passed audition
with the top score.

00:22:05.530 --> 00:22:07.060
May Wong...

00:22:07.060 --> 00:22:09.030
But why?

00:22:10.260 --> 00:22:14.500
I'm going to protect the Kaleido Stage
that Miss Layla entrusted me!

00:22:15.100 --> 00:22:17.830
I'm the one fit to be a Kaleido Star!

00:22:18.540 --> 00:22:19.900
Not you!

00:22:23.580 --> 00:22:28.640
A new Kaleido Stage has been set in motion...

00:22:31.820 --> 00:22:35.090
<i>All kinds of hard luck flocks your way
as if it's spurring you on</i>

00:22:31.820 --> 00:22:35.090
<i>Sekasu you ni muragaru Hard luck</i>

00:22:35.090 --> 00:22:38.320
<i>Swept away by it, time is over</i>

00:22:35.090 --> 00:22:38.320
<i>Nagasarete Time is over</i>

00:22:39.330 --> 00:22:42.130
<i>Just as it was predicted, take it easy</i>

00:22:39.330 --> 00:22:42.130
<i>Yokoku douri Take it easy</i>

00:22:42.130 --> 00:22:46.570
<i>I will get you out right away</i>

00:22:42.130 --> 00:22:46.570
<i>Tsuredasu yo imasugu</i>

00:22:46.570 --> 00:22:48.270
<i>Hurry up (Here we go)</i>

00:22:46.570 --> 00:22:48.270
<i>Hurry up (here we go)</i>

