<i>Harbor light (Stormy night)</i>

00:22:55.940 --> 00:22:57.850
<i>Harbor light (stormy night)</i>

00:22:57.850 --> 00:23:01.650
<i>Escape for the sake of tomorrow</i>

00:22:57.850 --> 00:23:01.650
<i>Asuno tame ni escape</i>

00:23:02.550 --> 00:23:08.320
<i>Even I don't have a vacation,
I've got an oasis</i>

00:23:02.550 --> 00:23:08.320
<i>Bakansu nashi demo oashisu wa get</i>

00:23:08.320 --> 00:23:14.750
<i>I'll turn off the cell phone
and charge my love</i>

00:23:08.320 --> 00:23:14.750
<i>Keitai off tte ai o charge shite</i>

00:23:15.360 --> 00:23:19.600
<i>Because some pain,
you can't soothe with just kindness</i>

00:23:15.360 --> 00:23:19.600
<i>Yasashisa dake ja iyasenai itami mo aru kara</i>

00:23:19.600 --> 00:23:23.470
<i>We are alone. We pass each other</i>

00:23:19.600 --> 00:23:23.470
<i>We are alone. Surechigau</i>

00:23:23.900 --> 00:23:24.870
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:23:23.900 --> 00:23:24.870
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:23:25.110 --> 00:23:30.130
<i>At the far end of regret,
I encounter my true heart</i>

00:23:25.110 --> 00:23:30.130
<i>Koukai no hate ni deau true heart</i>

00:23:30.780 --> 00:23:37.510
<i>Whether I'm crying or laughing,
I will be with you</i>

00:23:30.780 --> 00:23:37.510
<i>Naite mo waratte mo I'll be with U</i>

00:23:40.550 --> 00:23:42.850
Next Kaleido Star: New Wings

00:23:43.190 --> 00:23:45.120
I'm not a kid anymore.

00:23:45.230 --> 00:23:46.260
And so, surprisingly,

00:23:46.260 --> 00:23:49.200
Rosetta came to us saying that she
wanted to join Kaleido Stage.

00:23:49.200 --> 00:23:50.630
But it seems there's some reason behind this.

00:23:50.630 --> 00:23:52.930
Sora, please help me.

00:23:52.930 --> 00:23:55.570
Of course, I want to stay with Rosetta, but...

00:23:55.570 --> 00:23:56.400
All right!

00:23:56.400 --> 00:24:00.070
For my beloved friend, Rosetta,
I'm going to help her out!

00:24:00.070 --> 00:24:01.870
I will! I will! I will!

